/v1/","context":{"app_id":2608610,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-2608610","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T07:32:44Z","value":2,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4373970","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2608610-1847286114032368","game_id":"steam-2608610","kind":"announcement","title":"5,000 Wishlists! Thank you all so much! 📦","summary":"We are beyond excited to announce that Gently Packed has officially crossed 5,000 wishlists on Steam!What makes this milestone even more special for us is the massive boom we experienced over this past month. The growth has been absolutely unreal, and seeing so many new faces join our community in such a short amount of time means the world to our small team.Every single share, kind comment, and wishlist addition brings us closer to our upcoming Early Access launch on November 19th. Knowing that","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T12:04:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032368","verified_at":"2026-10-22T13:57:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2608610-1846651706691528","game_id":"steam-2608610","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest is HERE, Along with a Brand New Gently Packed Demo! 📦","summary":"Steam Next Fest is here, and we have been hard at work getting everything ready for you! We have very neatly, and GENTLY, packed a fresh batch of updates and improvements into our new demo, which you will get to play during the event.Here is a sneak peek at what is newNew Customer Request Type: Bringing even more variety to your daily packing routine.Product Condition Updates: A slightly higher chance for products to arrive already broken, so keep an eye out.Scanner Polish: Added scanner idle an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:03:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691528","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2608610-1846018067940452","game_id":"steam-2608610","kind":"announcement","title":"Early Access is coming on November 19!","summary":"Hey everyone! We finally have a date to share with you! Gently Packed is officially launching into Early Access on November 19th, in just over a month!We realize a rather large, highly anticipated game is also launching on that exact same day. If you wake up on that day and decide you do not actually want to steal cars and outrun the police, we will be there for you with a more gentle alternative. You can safely scan groceries, organize bags, and pay off a low-stakes corporate franchise loan wit","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T09:46:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067940452","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2608610-1846018067933017","game_id":"steam-2608610","kind":"announcement","title":"Shanghai RedNote 2.0 Wrap-Up 🌸","summary":"What an unforgettable week! I want to say a huge thank you to everyone who visited our booth, tried out Gently Packed, and said hi to us at RedNote 2.0 in Shanghai! I’m still fighting a bit of jet lag, but that is a tiny price to pay for such an incredible adventure. Meeting so many wonderful players, connecting with incredible fellow developers, and experiencing the event firsthand was truly a highlight of my life. Your feedback throughout the event was absolutely mind-blowing! I’m going to tak","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T11:35:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067933017","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2608610-1844751498224165","game_id":"steam-2608610","kind":"announcement","title":"Finding Peace in the Checkout Line","summary":"Hello Ladies & Gentelman!Today, we want to take you on a sentimental journey and tell you the story behind Gently Packed...New way of shoppingIf you have walked into a supermarket recently, you have probably noticed self-checkouts taking over. During peak hours, using them can feel like a high-stakes race against the growing line of impatient people behind you.One evening, while doing a late-night grocery run in a completely empty store, I noticed something unexpected. Without the pressure of a ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T11:03:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498224165","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2608610-1842846814442758","game_id":"steam-2608610","kind":"announcement","title":"Gently Packed Has Found a Publisher!","summary":"Hey everyone! We have some huge news to share today: our cozy cashier simulator, Gently Packed, has officially joined forces with Pixel Doors as our publisher! We’re beyond thrilled to team up with them. Together, we’re going to work on making store management and bag packing in Gently Packed even more satisfying, relaxing, and fun for all of you. BUT THAT’S NOT ALL THE NEWS! First off, if you happen to be in Shanghai between October 2nd and October 6th, you’ll be able to play a hands-on floor b","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T09:34:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814442758","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2608610-1835871199305023","game_id":"steam-2608610","kind":"update","title":"Operational Independence - Update","summary":"The Store, Inc. is pleased to announce that personnel are now trusted to manage their own inventory. This trust was not earned. It was reallocated, following a budget review that identified automatic restocking as a cost the corporation would prefer you absorb.The Warehouse Is Yours Now The warehouse is fully operational and entirely your concern. Between shifts, visit the wholesaler, restock by category and prepare your shelves for the day ahead. Plan poorly and you will run dry mid-shift, at w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-18T17:20:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199305023","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2608610-1832065502815031","game_id":"steam-2608610","kind":"update","title":"Controller Authorized - Update","summary":"The Store, Inc. is pleased to announce that following 17 quarters of internal review, personnel are now authorized to operate franchise locations using a standard input controller. The decision was reached after the Ergonomics Subcommittee reviewed a series of incidents involving keyboards, wrists, and what one report described as \"a sound the human hand should not produce.\" The corporation regrets nothing and admits to less.All cashier duties can now be done using the controller. Scanning, pack","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-08T12:26:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502815031","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2608610-1826362059926715","game_id":"steam-2608610","kind":"update","title":"Open for Business Update","summary":"The corporate headquarters are finally open - and they've got some offers you can't refuse.This update covers a lot of ground: the workday is longer, your progress now saves, packing has new rules, and you can finally visit the Corp building and buy upgrades.Longer Workday The most common feedback we got was that the demo felt too short. We heard you. The workday is now longer, so you'll get to serve more customers before the shift ends.Your Progress is Now Saved The demo finally has a full save","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-07T13:57:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059926715","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2608610-1826362059924880","game_id":"steam-2608610","kind":"announcement","title":"Women's Day Broadcast","summary":"In celebration of Women's Day, we're starting a new gameplay broadcast. An updated version of the demo is also ready to try.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-06T16:28:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059924880","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2608610-1823825466503169","game_id":"steam-2608610","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: New Languages Added","summary":"Hey everyone!Quick update - we've added 8 new languages to the Gently Packed demo!If you’ve already tried the demo, feel free to jump back in and check it out. And if you notice anything odd with the translations, please let us know using the in-game feedback option - it really helps us improve.Thanks again for all the support!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-08T10:35:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1823825466503169","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2608610-1823825466501663","game_id":"steam-2608610","kind":"announcement","title":"Gently Packed Demo Now Available","summary":"Hey everyone! The Gently Packed demo is now live on Steam! We’re super excited to finally let you try the game and see how a day in Gently Packed plays out. The demo offers a small, cozy slice of the experience and is a great way to get a feel for the game. If you enjoy it, consider adding Gently Packed to your wishlist - it really helps us as a small team. We’d love to hear your thoughts and feedback, so feel free to share them using the form: https://forms.gle/zFBNmw9YUVDLBqvn6 Thanks for play","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-07T13:37:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1823825466501663","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2608610":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:44Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:44Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2608610":"2026-10-26T09:54:44Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2608610":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:44Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:44Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:44Z"},"4373970":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:44Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:44Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"la